>> hex := Ifomethi okusha: ['%x'].

# write 10
Okuphumayo bhala: Hx xA, umugqa-omusha.

# make it easy to write numbers as hex
Inombolo uma-kufika: ['as-hex'] yenza: { <- hex sebenzisa-kunombolo-ephelele: uqobo.
}.

# write
Okuphumayo bhala: Hx xA as-hex, umugqa-omusha.
Okuphumayo bhala: Hx xFF as-hex, umugqa-omusha.